{"product_id":"gq-how-to-win-at-life-the-expert-guide-to-excelling-at-everything-you-do","title":"GQ How to Win at Life The expert guide to excelling at everything you do","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom the magazine synonymous with looking sharp and living smart comes the definitive handbook of skills for the modern man. Based on interviews with the world's foremost authorities, and wisdom from GQ's editors, step-by-step guides show you how to win at fashion, sport, food and drink, work, romance, travel and more...Entries include:» How to mix an unimpeachable dirty martini» How to pack a suit» How to spot a fake Rolex» How to get quality sleep on a night flight» How to dance without looking like dad» How to hit an evil squash serve» How to ace an interview» How to give a killer foot massage» How to escape from a sinking car\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 212\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Mitchell Beazley\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781784724580\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890774204569,"sku":"14RB9781784724580","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6914865cefc0a_GQ_How_to_Win_at_Life_The_expert_guide_to_excelling_at_everything_you_do.jpg?v=1763046858","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/gq-how-to-win-at-life-the-expert-guide-to-excelling-at-everything-you-do","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}